### unescaped star in expr multiplication
# shellcheck disable=SC2003
area=$(expr 4 * 2)
>>> SC2034 2:1
>>> SC2035 2:15
>>> SC2304 2:15

### escaped star is literal
# shellcheck disable=SC2003
area=$(expr 4 \* 2)
>>> SC2034 2:1

### quoted star is literal
# shellcheck disable=SC2003
area=$(expr 4 '*' 2)
>>> SC2034 2:1
